      ],
      "text": "The backend exposes REST endpoints for uploading and listing session attachments (POST/GET /api/uploads/{session_id}), artifact-event polling, per-artifact download with meta/stream modes, and a whole-session zip download, with WebSocket mirrors emitting artifact_created events."
    },
    {
