      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fe1394e38520b70a496946041e484efdcc1f482934751b7a751b9d963d40660a"
      ],
      "text": "The memory system offers four built-in store types: simple (FAISS plus semantic rerank, read/write), file (read-only vector index over documents), blackboard (append-only recency log), and mem0 (cloud-managed, requires the mem0ai package)."
    },
