        "slc_7c79f7fd54ea9bc731b802023b991d6e8074ac323e5eddfeb4a4c5698e72de9f"
      ],
      "text": "The project is modular: server/ hosts the FastAPI backend, runtime/ handles agent abstraction and tool execution, workflow/ contains multi-agent logic driven by entity/ configs, frontend/ is a Vue 3 web console, and functions/ holds custom Python tools."
    },
